    "name": "Lil' Snot: Moon Escape",
    "steam_appid": 3796610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lil' Snot: Moon Escape is a <strong>difficult, minimalist, precision-platformer</strong>. <strong>Sling</strong> yourself through <strong>5 levels</strong> with <strong>unique mechanics</strong> each to test your capabilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to beat my fastest finish time of 2:39!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lil' snot has always wanted to see what's outside of his moon prison, it's up to you to help the lil' snot escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an atmospheric moon-ish soundtrack and the silence of the character in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By holding down <strong>Mouse Button Left</strong> and <strong>dragging down</strong> and <strong>aiming</strong> like a <strong>bow</strong>, <strong>let go</strong> and the lil' snot will be <strong>shot</strong> like an <strong>arrow</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use\u00a0<strong>A</strong> and <strong>D</strong> to <strong>move</strong> and get the placement you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage has varying <strong>platforming mechanics</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sticky walls, repulsion walls, invisible platforms, teleporting platforms, portals, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 30 Minutes - 3 Hours (varies based on skill and experience)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lil' Snot: Moon Escape is a <strong>difficult, minimalist, precision-platformer</strong>. <strong>Sling</strong> yourself through <strong>5 levels</strong> with <strong>unique mechanics</strong> each to test your capabilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to beat my fastest finish time of 2:39!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lil' snot has always wanted to see what's outside of his moon prison, it's up to you to help the lil' snot escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an atmospheric moon-ish soundtrack and the silence of the character in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By holding down <strong>Mouse Button Left</strong> and <strong>dragging down</strong> and <strong>aiming</strong> like a <strong>bow</strong>, <strong>let go</strong> and the lil' snot will be <strong>shot</strong> like an <strong>arrow</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use\u00a0<strong>A</strong> and <strong>D</strong> to <strong>move</strong> and get the placement you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage has varying <strong>platforming mechanics</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sticky walls, repulsion walls, invisible platforms, teleporting platforms, portals, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 30 Minutes - 3 Hours (varies based on skill and experience)</p>",
